This plan follows the seven-step credibility assessment framework set out in
FDA's January 2025 draft guidance *Considerations for the Use of Artificial
Intelligence to Support Regulatory Decision-Making for Drug and Biological
Products*. That guidance is a **draft** and has not been finalised; the
framework is applied here as best practice, alongside the final standards the
validation plan cites.

